  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual general contribution to The Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations FAO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerns the annual general contribution to The Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations FAO working to achieve food security for all and make sure that people have regular access to enough high-quality food to lead active, healthy lives. FAO has a mandate to improve nutrition, increase agricultural productivity, raise the standard of living in rural populations and contribute to global economic growth. The contribution concerns part of the annual general contribution to FAO that is reportable as official development assistance (ODA).</narrative>
  </description>
